esentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e第五章 第三幕「镜与谜烟的彼方」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"503380\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/16/80663279/8d13718394910e0eb47b42159a7fa4f3_1590899691929024899.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"第五章 第四幕「命定将焚的虹光」\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/503380/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/503380/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e第五章 第四幕「命定将焚的虹光」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"504033\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/01/01/80663279/8d13718394910e0eb47b42159a7fa4f3_7610498574503476711.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"第五章 第五幕「炽烈的还魂诗」\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/504033/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/504033/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e第五章 第五幕「炽烈的还魂诗」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e世界任务：\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"502895\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/08/82503813/8d13718394910e0eb47b42159a7fa4f3_7768026939515217526.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"在应许与遗忘之间\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502895/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502895/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e在应许与遗忘之间\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3882","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"676ap5v1529T1736324156813\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"j2nc859t22hT1724853320513\",\"fwz4tosmhewT1728582876185\",\"abuau7r0zz8T1728744228672\",\"676ap5v1529T1736324156813\",\"av6lgjqkscuT1724853321217\"],\"abuau7r0zz8T1728744228672\":[],\"av6lgjqkscuT1724853321217\":[],\"fwz4tosmhewT1728582876185\":[\"qbbpijq1siaT1728582985115\"],\"j2nc859t22hT1724853320513\":[\"yybtk48kq4T1724853358675\"],\"qbbpijq1siaT1728582985115\":[],\"yybtk48kq4T1724853358675\":[]},\"contents\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【】\"},\"676ap5v1529T1736324156813\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没有永远的胜利，但它的果实依旧甘甜。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e感谢「基扬戈兹」\u003cem\u003e[领袖]\u003c/em\u003e与「杜麦尼」\u003cem\u003e[希望]\u003c/em\u003e，英雄的事迹将与彩石与群山同在。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你看，就像战士们常说的，只要万众一心，我们一定可以坚持到最后的胜利。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【关于深渊…】——完成魔神任务 第五章第五幕「炽烈的还魂诗」后\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e肚子好像小了一圈…吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唉，好像是错觉。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"abuau7r0zz8T1728744228672\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e之前那场对抗深渊的胜利属于纳塔每一个人。它是伟大的，但无疑也是暂时的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e火神大人在战后来过几次，询问了回声之子的伤亡情况，也为重建工作提供了很大的支援。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过火神大人也强调了，深渊并未被完全打败，我们还需继续保持警惕。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e也多谢你的关心和付出，我想，只要万众一心，我们一定可以坚持到最后的胜利。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(140, 140, 140)\\\"\u003e（该对话将在完成魔神任务 第五章第五幕「炽烈的还魂诗」后消失）\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【关于对抗深渊…】——完成魔神任务 第五章第四幕「命定将焚的虹光」后\"},\"av6lgjqkscuT1724853321217\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e再见啦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【再见。】\"},\"fwz4tosmhewT1728582876185\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你好啊，朋友。最近怎么样，一路上还顺利吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e卡齐娜的伙伴就是回声之子的伙伴，这里永远欢迎你。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e当然其他部族也很值得参观、去流泉之众游游泳，或者到花羽会那边坐热气球，也都挺有趣的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【又见面了。】——完成魔神任务第五章 第一幕「荣花与炎日之途」后\"},\"j2nc859t22hT1724853320513\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你好，我是回声之子的部族首领。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，说是首领…比起管理大家的生活，我还是更喜欢支持和保护大家啊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【你好。】\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【】\"},\"qbbpijq1siaT1728582985115\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哎，不用这么客气，我们其实很喜欢和外面来的人做朋友。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e彼此都能从对方身上学到很多东西呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【获得\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1025\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/20/15568211/d50fb37e3954b2b7105c61cf8f442c6e_7679619291811796065.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"大英雄的经验\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1025/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1025/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/20/15568211/d50fb37e3954b2b7105c61cf8f442c6e_7679619291811796065.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e大英雄的经验\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/11/288180982/b26706122e54335e75a99308e473cc62_3158421570534395987.png\",\"option\":\"【多谢建议。】——获得大英雄的经验*2\"},\"yybtk48kq4T1724853358675\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊呀…这个…说来话长…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e简而言之，我当年也是一名期待得到大灵认可的潇洒少年。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e但当发现自己可能永远也拿不到「古名」之后，吃东西成了我排解压力的主要方式。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过我现在已经不执着于「古名」了。就算不能参加战斗，我也能通过别的办法支援大家。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e纳塔就是这样的，谁都不会孤军奋战。人的决心就像体重一样，不是那么容易消减的哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【关于肚子的故事…】\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【】\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1736326679","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1210","pos":"banner"},{"id":"3885","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"694","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1211","pos":"left"},{"id":"1212","pos":"right"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"}]}]},"edit_lock_status":"Unlock","correct_lock_status":"Unlock","menus":[{"id":"20","name":"NPC\u0026商店","has_page":false,"style":"","sub_menus":[],"icon":"","mi18n_key":"NPC\u0026商店","is_hidden":false,"parent_id":"189","template_id":"","bg_img":"","ch_ext":"[{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"每行个数\",\"attribute_key\":\"col_per_row\",\"value\":\"2\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"展示样式\",\"attribute_key\":\"display_ty